<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia passenger car sales 28,290 units in March.</title>
<headline>Malaysia passenger car sales 28,290 units in March.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's passenger car sales, including four-wheel-drive vehicles for private use, totalled 28,290 units in March against 19,541 in March last year, the Malaysian Motor Traders' Association (MMTA) said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
